                            <p class="ausSMSText2" style="display:none;">
                                {!mediumTemplateForCust}  
                            </p>
                            <p class="ausSMSText3" style="display:none;">
                                {!firmTemplateForCust}  
                            </p>
                            <p class="nzSMSText1" style="display:none;">
                                Hi {!Collection_Activity__c.Applicant__r.FirstName}, unfortunately your Rent4keeps payment of ${!Collection_Activity__c.Applicant__r.Schedule_Amount__c} has been missed! Easily catch up on your payment at {!Collection_Activity__c.Short_Link__c} or call one of our friendly staff on {!opportunity.Account.Territory_Number__r.Collection_Number__c}
                            </p>
                            <p class="nzSMSText2" style="display:none;">
                                Hi {!Collection_Activity__c.Applicant__r.FirstName}, Urgent payment needed for ${!Collection_Activity__c.Applicant__r.Schedule_Amount__c} that was due on &nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,date,dd/MM/yyyy}"><apex:param value="{!TODAY()}"/></apex:outputText>, to avoid further action against you pay now at {!Collection_Activity__c.Short_Link__c} or call one of our friendly staff on {!opportunity.Account.Territory_Number__r.Collection_Number__c} to resolve immediately!
                            </p>
                            <p class="nzSMSText3" style="display:none;">
                                Hi {!Collection_Activity__c.Applicant__r.FirstName}, your Rent4keeps payment of ${!Collection_Activity__c.Applicant__r.Schedule_Amount__c} is seriously overdue and needs to be paid ASAP. Avoid a Repossession Warning Notice by calling today on {!opportunity.Account.Territory_Number__r.Collection_Number__c} to talk with us about your payment options or pay now at {!Collection_Activity__c.Short_Link__c}
                            </p>
